@startuml Cancel Approved Request Alternate Flow - State Diagram
title Cancel Approved Request Alternate Flow - State Diagram

[*] --> Authenticated

Authenticated --> ViewHome: Navigate to VTS

ViewHome --> ViewBalance: Display request summary\nand balances

ViewBalance --> SelectRequest: Employee selects\napproved request

SelectRequest --> ApprovedState: Request status:\nApproved

ApprovedState --> CheckTiming: Check request timing

CheckTiming --> FutureRequest: Request is in the future
CheckTiming --> RecentPastRequest: Request is in recent past\n(previous 5 business days)

FutureRequest --> ConfirmCancel: VTS prompts for\nconfirmation only

RecentPastRequest --> ConfirmCancelWithExpl: VTS prompts for confirmation\nAND explanation required

ConfirmCancel --> EmployeeConfirms: Employee confirms

ConfirmCancelWithExpl --> EmployeeConfirms: Employee confirms\nand provides explanation

EmployeeConfirms --> Canceled: Request state changed\nto canceled

EmployeeConfirms --> AbortCancel: Employee aborts\ncancellation

AbortCancel --> NoChanges: No changes made\nto requests

Canceled --> ReturnTime: Time allowances\nreturned to employee

ReturnTime --> NotifyManager: Notification email\nsent to manager

NotifyManager --> UpdateHome: Return to home page\nwith updated summaries

NoChanges --> UpdateHome: Return to home page

UpdateHome --> [*]

note right of ApprovedState
  Precondition: Request must be
  approved and scheduled for
  future or recent past
end note

note right of RecentPastRequest
  Cancellations within 5 business days
  require justification
end note

note right of ReturnTime
  Used time allowances are
  restored to employee balance
end note

@enduml
